# PantryTwin environment
#
# Copy to .env.local for development. Never commit a real key.
# The app runs without any of these; each one is additive.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gemini
# Enables the planning assistant. Without it every metric still works and the
# explanation panel says plainly that no key is configured.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-3.6-flash.
# Free-tier 3.6 Flash is about 5 requests/minute and 20/day. Each Ask now
# uses one request. If 3.6 is exhausted, the server tries the overflow model.
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
GEMINI_FALLBACK_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- Census
# Used only by `npm run ingest`, never at request time.
# Without it, tract population still comes from Baltimore City's own layer,
# but poverty rate and vehicle access stay unavailable rather than guessed.
# Free key: https://api.census.gov/data/key_signup.html
CENSUS_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Basemap
# MapLibre ships no basemap of its own, so the street tiles come from a third
# party. The default is CARTO Positron, which requires attribution (kept
# visible on the map). Review the provider's terms before production use, or
# point this at your own style. If the basemap is unreachable the app falls
# back to a plain background and still draws every data layer.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL=https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/gl/positron-gl-style/style.json
